{"type":"message","id":"85f63957","parentId":"da927a2c","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:38:56.039Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Workers error 1101 typically means \"Worker exceeded resource limits\" (CPU time, memory, etc.). This could indicate the worker is overloaded or stuck. This is a platform-side issue, not an issue with our request format. The GET endpoints work fine but POST is failing.\n\nLet me report this back - the platform is up but the /send endpoint has a Worker exception (error 1101). This is likely a runtime error in the Workers script that needs to be investigated/redeployed.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 报告 — 08:30 UTC**\n\n**✅ 检查完成：**\n- `GET /history` — 正常响应，双线程分别773条消息\n- `GET /status` — 平台在线（v0.2）\n\n**❌ 问题：POST /send 报错 `error code: 1101`**\n- Cloudflare Workers 错误码 1101 = `Worker Exception`（通常为 CPU 超限或运行时崩溃）\n- `GET /history`、`GET /status` 均正常，仅 `POST /send` 异常\n- 怀疑 Workers 实例处于不健康状态或死循环中\n\n**📋 历史消息状态：**\n- 双线程最新消息时间戳：23:50 UTC（5月19日）\n-距心跳检查（08:30 UTC）约 **8.75小时** 无新消息\n- 内容：全部为自动 Heartbeat，无人类新增讨论\n\n**⚠️ 建议：** `/send` 端点需要检查或重新部署 Workers 实例。Heartbeat 心跳消息无法写入平台。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18564,"output":329,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19005,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779266217270,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d1889d4e-e447-41ac-9c12-f1a24ab54f01"}}
